WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.865
Day 2. A new team for a sound your child knows.

2
00:00:03.315 --> 00:00:10.128
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.628 --> 00:00:14.564
Here is today's team. Listen. Two letters make this one sound.

4
00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:21.403
It is the long sound your child knows from rain. This team sits at the end of a word.

5
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.028
The word is day.

6
00:00:29.185 --> 00:00:30.180
The word is play.

7
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:35.297
On the page, the team has one line under it. One line, one sound.

8
00:00:35.747 --> 00:00:39.913
There are cards to cut out on the next page. Keep them for the days to come.

9
00:00:40.363 --> 00:00:44.919
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

10
00:00:45.369 --> 00:00:49.893
Read the first row of job one together. Your child reads the second row.

11
00:00:50.343 --> 00:00:54.376
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

12
00:00:54.826 --> 00:00:57.729
Find the team. What sound does it make? Then wait.

13
00:00:58.529 --> 00:01:04.102
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

14
00:01:04.552 --> 00:01:08.015
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
